  to take an unearned pass from it.

  Provenance across this archive is NOT uniform: the sibling flow evidence
  files are produced by a capture script, whereas this report is derived.
  That difference is stated explicitly here rather than left to be assumed.

  2a. DISCLOSED DIVERGENCE IN THE ENVIRONMENT FINDING
