  7. WHAT DELIBERATELY DOES NOT APPEAR
  ....................................
  7.1 No integration test report. The module's only test source file is
      ObjectConverterTest.java and it contains no integration test class.
      Independently, a unit test run stops at the test phase, whereas the
      integration test runner declares an execution whose two goals carry
      no explicit phase and therefore take their default phases, both of
      which fall after the test phase. That runner is declared in three
      POMs of the reactor, not in one; none of the three is this module, so
      the conclusion is unchanged. An absent integration test is neither a
      pass nor a failure, and it may never justify a test exclusion.
  7.2 No report and no testcase element for the nested fixture type
